#: ../../../developer/releases/4_0/release-notes.rst:53
#: 0a64c788060746aea75e118ea123f6e6
msgid "Security Notes"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/releases/4_0/release-notes.rst:56
#: f47dc98c60494677ac72aacdaace3aa6
msgid ""
"PV VMs migrated from 3.2 to 4.0-rc4 or later are automatically set to PVH "
"mode in order to protect against Meltdown (see `QSB #37 <https://github.com/"
"QubesOS/qubes-secpack/blob/master/QSBs/qsb-037-2018.txt>`__). However, PV "
"VMs migrated from any earlier 4.0 release candidate (RC1, RC2, or RC3) are "
"not automatically set to PVH mode. These must be set manually."
msgstr ""

