#: ../../../developer/releases/4_0/release-notes.rst:114
#: 6c65b9d69e474f5cbadffbb1b3d5d757
msgid ""
"Locale using coma as decimal separator `crashes qubesd <https://github.com/"
"QubesOS/qubes-issues/issues/3753>`__. Either install with different locale "
