"that issue."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/releases/4_0/release-notes.rst:116
#: 2cf7d42069aa4a8b9b513d1c74d01f95
msgid ""
"In the middle of installation, `keyboard layout reset to US <https://github."
"com/QubesOS/qubes-issues/issues/3352>`__. Be careful what is the current "
"layout while setting default user password (see upper right screen corner)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/releases/4_0/release-notes.rst:118
#: f2bf3931fe064aafbf6b132452468a55
msgid ""
